# **SUVHOA Facilities**

All HOA facilities are located at 7290 Davenport 
Road. Members are welcome to use the clubhouse, pool, tennis court, ½ basketball 
court and playground. Your key card will open 
the gates for both the pool area and tennis 
courts. 

## Swimming Pool 
The pool is open to members from 6:00 am to 
10:00 pm.

## Tennis Courts
Tennis courts are open year-round from sunrise 
to sundown.

## Playground
The playground is open throughout the year
